From 5394d35dd68fa590e30917a42ddd611fcf141eed Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Stefan <kloterstefan@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 11:23:29 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 23/24] Vizzbox 1.1: the version 1.1 (FM-1_851), a release
 reproducible to the byte, the installer's way from and to 1.0, the browser
 version's new controls (BRIEF-VIZZBOX-1.1.md 6, 8, 9)

FELUCCA_VERSION v1.1 (the splash, ABOUT, the editor; a release X.Y is FM-1_8(X+4)Y: 1.1 FM-1_851, as build.py makes
it). tools/build.py: with SOURCE_DATE_EPOCH, ABOUT's build date (__DATE__) that day, so the release is the same bytes on
every build (build-vizzbox.sh fixes it). The installer: its texts for 1.x; web/test_vizzbox_installer.mjs also the
Vizzbox 1.0's installer as it shipped over a 1.1 (no backup, installed; with this one over a 1.0 already there: 1.0 to
1.1 and back). The browser version: its key overview with the mouse's way to hold a button (a right-click), and
web/emu/test_vizzbox_emu.mjs the new controls from the keyboard and the mouse (EDIT, SEL + a black key, FX held, a
latched button). tests/run_tests.sh: the version from felucca.c for the installer too. tests/ui_golden.txt: the 42
pictures that show the version (ABOUT, ABOUT while recording, the splash, every palette and style) now v1.1, nothing
else. tests/vizzbox_budget.c: each sound timed over 4 s (one was too short to tell the engines apart).

Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01R1rawochSWXFaES57pjc4r
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 firmware/src/felucca.c         |  2 +-
 tests/run_tests.sh             |  8 ++--
 tests/ui_golden.txt            | 84 +++++++++++++++++-----------------
 tests/vizzbox_budget.c         | 13 +++---
 tests/vizzbox_mutants.py       |  4 +-
 tools/build.py                 | 11 ++++-
 web/emu/make_vizzbox_emu.py    | 41 ++++++++++++++++-
 web/emu/test_vizzbox_emu.mjs   | 36 ++++++++++++++-
 web/make_vizzbox_installer.py  | 12 ++---
 web/test_vizzbox_installer.mjs | 14 +++++-
 10 files changed, 157 insertions(+), 68 deletions(-)

diff --git a/firmware/src/felucca.c b/firmware/src/felucca.c
index fa8474b..9e31b12 100644
--- a/firmware/src/felucca.c
+++ b/firmware/src/felucca.c
@@ -47,7 +47,7 @@
 #endif
 #endif
 #ifndef FELUCCA_VERSION
-#define FELUCCA_VERSION "v1.0"     /* (Vizzbox) the Vizzbox's (Vizz 2.0's v2.0, Skiff 2.0.1's v2.0.1); shown in the menu,
+#define FELUCCA_VERSION "v1.1"     /* (Vizzbox) the Vizzbox's (Vizz 2.0's v2.0, Skiff 2.0.1's v2.0.1); shown in the menu,
                                     * the console and the editor; build.py --release X.Y */
 #endif
 #if FELUCCA_OTA && !FELUCCA_FLASH
diff --git a/tests/run_tests.sh b/tests/run_tests.sh
index 804e3f6..e01705b 100755
--- a/tests/run_tests.sh
+++ b/tests/run_tests.sh
@@ -85,7 +85,7 @@
 #                   tests/vizz10_fixture.sh): the backup first, the install, the conversion of what 2.0 can't read;
 #                   a Vizz 1.x by its identity, Skiff 1.4 and a development build by the version; 2.0 installed as it is
 # VIZZBOX INSTALLER (web/test_vizzbox_installer.mjs, the same way): the Vizzbox's installer over the same units, over
-#                   Vizz 2.0, Skiff 2.0.1 and a Vizzbox (FM-1_850, v1.0: by its identity) installed only; Vizz 2.0's
+#                   Vizz 2.0, Skiff 2.0.1 and a Vizzbox (FM-1_850, FM-1_851: by its identity) installed only; Vizz 2.0's
 #                   installer over a Vizzbox the same; Skiff's own page over one (by the version) writes nothing back
 # VIZZBOX (Vizzbox, the browser emulator's device built natively with VIZZBOX=1): tests/producer_test.c (every
 #                   subgenre in every LENGTH, determinism, transport and CC 104..109, live moves, MUTE / SOLO, ENDLESS
@@ -576,19 +576,19 @@ else
         python3 web/make_vizz_installer.py build/felucca.fwsc 2.0 "$OUT/vizz-installer.html" build/conv/conv.wasm
     run "(Vizz) the installer in Chromium over a unit running Vizz 1.0 (tests/vizz10_unit.json): backup, install, conversion; Vizz 1.x by its identity, 2.0 as it is" \
         node web/test_vizz_installer.mjs "$OUT/vizz-installer.html" tests/vizz10_unit.json build/conv/conv.wasm
+    FV=$(sed -n 's/^#define FELUCCA_VERSION "\([^"]*\)".*/\1/p' firmware/src/felucca.c)   # ((1.1) the version: v1.1)
     run "(Vizzbox) the one-file installer (web/make_vizzbox_installer.py): the package and conv.wasm in it" \
-        python3 web/make_vizzbox_installer.py build/felucca.fwsc 1.0 "$OUT/vizzbox-installer.html" build/conv/conv.wasm
+        python3 web/make_vizzbox_installer.py build/felucca.fwsc "${FV#v}" "$OUT/vizzbox-installer.html" build/conv/conv.wasm
     run "(Vizzbox) the installer over Vizz 1.0 / 1.x, Skiff 1.4, a dev build: backup, conversion; over 2.0 and a Vizzbox installed only; Vizz 2.0's over a Vizzbox the same" \
         node web/test_vizzbox_installer.mjs "$OUT/vizzbox-installer.html" tests/vizz10_unit.json build/conv/conv.wasm "$OUT/vizz-installer.html"
     mkdir -p build/emu_vizzbox
-    FV=$(sed -n 's/^#define FELUCCA_VERSION "\([^"]*\)".*/\1/p' firmware/src/felucca.c)
     run "(Vizzbox) the browser emulator with the producer (VIZZBOX=1 -> build/emu_vizzbox/felucca.wasm)" \
         emcc -O2 -ffp-contract=off -std=gnu99 -w -DVIZZBOX=1 "-DFELUCCA_VERSION=\"$FV\"" -Ibuild/gen -Ifirmware/src \
         --no-entry -sSTANDALONE_WASM -sSTACK_SIZE=1048576 -sINITIAL_MEMORY=33554432 -sFILESYSTEM=0 \
         -o build/emu_vizzbox/felucca.wasm web/emu/felucca_web.c
     run "(Vizzbox) the one-file Vizzbox in the browser (web/emu/make_vizzbox_emu.py)" \
         python3 web/emu/make_vizzbox_emu.py build/emu_vizzbox/felucca.wasm "${FV#v}" "$OUT/vizzbox-emu.html"
-    run "(Vizzbox) it in Chromium from the disk: switched on, the VIZZBOX, KNOB 1, PLAY (the screen, the audio), stop" \
+    run "(Vizzbox) it in Chromium from the disk: switched on, the VIZZBOX, KNOB 1, PLAY (the screen, the audio); (1.1) EDIT, SEL + a black key, FX held, a button held by a right-click, the key overview; stop" \
         node web/emu/test_vizzbox_emu.mjs "$OUT/vizzbox-emu.html"
 fi
 
